      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc χMT decreases from 51.2 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K to 38.8 at 20.0 K and 31.5 at 5.0 K, slightly below the spin-only 55.5 cm3 K mol−1 for non-interacting Gd4Mn8, indicating dominant antiferromagnetic Gd···Mn coupling. Ac χ′MT at 1000 Hz falls from 38.4 cm3 K mol−1 at 15 K to 22.6 at 1.8 K. No frequency-dependent ac signals down to 1.8 K; not an SMM.",
